				<title>Great song</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-914890/track-4:you-and-me#post-4500476</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 14 Feb 2020 09:29:07 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>SuperCatPrincess</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1824946</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I clicked on a Youtube video (Exploring Series) expecting Fifthism and a bunch of crazy shenanigans involving insane people fucking around with stars and shit. And at the end there was this song. I'm currently in a long distance relationship and it's currently Valentine's Day and congratulations, you have joined the ranks of my crippling self doubt, a particularly stressful backpacking trip, and Mother 3 in &quot;things that made me cry&quot;.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
