					<![CDATA[
						 <p>so i had know this is like months late but i have returned literally just to say that i now have an official ukulele chord sheet for this song if anybody is interested. im not quite sure the best way to share it, maybe through a google drive link? idk. let me know if anybody is still interested, i would love to hear cover versions.</p> <p>also props to you for trying to do it by ear, i put some real stupid chords in there and also its in G-flat major for most of it so doubly hard</p> 
